    "Condition : 1 - The operations, erection of a hip to gable and rear dormer roof extension and installation of an obscure glazed and non opening window the side elevation, would consist of the enlargement of a dwelling house within the meaning of Class B of Part 1 of Schedule 2 to the Town & Country Planning (General Permitted Development)  (England) Order 2015 \"the Order\" and would comply with the development tolerances set out in said Class B. The operation would therefore have been granted planning permission by Article 3 of the Order.",
